{"id": "canon-d3-01", "surface": "jan pi jan jan", "rationale": "Folding jan jan would leave a group of one (jan pi D1(jan)), which is invalid; the fold is not applied and the unfolded group [jan jan] stands.", "source_rule": "SPEC 2.18, 7; author decision 2026-10-09 D3 (META fold fallback)", "expect_status": "RESOLVED", "expect_skeletons": ["{jan pi jan jan}"], "expect_asts": [{"groups": [{"left": {"token": "jan", "type": "unit"}, "right": {"token": "jan", "type": "unit"}, "type": "group"}], "head": [{"token": "jan", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}], "review": "ACCEPTED - author decision 2026-10-09"}
{"id": "canon-d3-02", "surface": "jan pi ma ma", "rationale": "As canon-d3-01 with a repeated unit that differs from the head: the folded reading jan pi D1(ma) is invalid, the unfolded group [ma ma] is used.", "source_rule": "SPEC 2.18, 7; author decision 2026-10-09 D3 (META fold fallback)", "expect_status": "RESOLVED", "expect_skeletons": ["{jan pi ma ma}"], "expect_asts": [{"groups": [{"left": {"token": "ma", "type": "unit"}, "right": {"token": "ma", "type": "unit"}, "type": "group"}], "head": [{"token": "jan", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}], "review": "ACCEPTED - author decision 2026-10-09"}
{"id": "canon-d4-01", "surface": "ma li tan ma tan ma ma", "rationale": "Two valid readings with incomparable fold sets: {D1(tan ma) ma} folds positions 2-5, tan {ma} tan {D1(ma)} folds 5-6. Step 1 keeps both; step 2 keeps the one whose structural-tan set {2,4} includes the other's empty set.", "source_rule": "SPEC 2.18, 7; author decision 2026-10-09 D4 (lexicographic priority)", "expect_status": "RESOLVED", "expect_skeletons": ["({ma} li tan {ma} tan {D1(ma)})"], "expect_asts": [{"predicates": [{"head": null, "objects": null, "sources": {"items": [{"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "ma", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, {"groups": [], "head": [{"depth": 1, "type": "meta", "unit": [{"token": "ma", "type": "unit"}]}], "type": "phrase"}], "type": "source_list"}, "type": "predicate"}], "subject": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "ma", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "type": "predication"}], "review": "ACCEPTED - author decision 2026-10-09"}
{"id": "canon-d4-02", "surface": "tan li jan jan tan jan tan", "rationale": "Fold sets {2,3} (D1(jan)) and {3..6} (D1(jan tan)) are incomparable; the first reading has structural tan {4}, the second none, so step 2 keeps the first.", "source_rule": "SPEC 2.18, 7; author decision 2026-10-09 D4 (lexicographic priority)", "expect_status": "RESOLVED", "expect_skeletons": ["({tan} li {D1(jan)} tan {jan tan})"], "expect_asts": [{"predicates": [{"head": {"groups": [], "head": [{"depth": 1, "type": "meta", "unit": [{"token": "jan", "type": "unit"}]}], "type": "phrase"}, "objects": null, "sources": {"items": [{"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "jan", "type": "unit"}, {"token": "tan", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}], "type": "source_list"}, "type": "predicate"}], "subject": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "tan", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "type": "predication"}], "review": "ACCEPTED - author decision 2026-10-09"}
{"id": "canon-d4-03", "surface": "jan li tan tan ma", "rationale": "META before structure: the folded reading {D1(tan) ma} has fold set {2,3}; the unfolded readings (tan {tan ma}, {tan} tan {ma}) fold nothing, so step 1 drops them although they have a structural tan.", "source_rule": "SPEC 2.18, 7; author decision 2026-10-09 D4 (lexicographic priority)", "expect_status": "RESOLVED", "expect_skeletons": ["({jan} li {D1(tan) ma})"], "expect_asts": [{"predicates": [{"head": {"groups": [], "head": [{"depth": 1, "type": "meta", "unit": [{"token": "tan", "type": "unit"}]}, {"token": "ma", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "objects": null, "sources": null, "type": "predicate"}], "subject": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "jan", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "type": "predication"}], "review": "ACCEPTED - author decision 2026-10-09"}
{"id": "canon-d4-04", "surface": "jan li tan tan ma tan ma", "rationale": "Incomparable after both steps: {D1(tan) ma} tan {ma} folds {2,3} with structural tan {5}; tan {D1(tan ma)} folds {3..6} with structural tan {2}. Neither fold set nor structural set includes the other, so both readings stay.", "source_rule": "SPEC 2.18, 7; author decision 2026-10-09 D4 (lexicographic priority)", "expect_status": "AMBIGUOUS", "expect_skeletons": ["({jan} li tan {D1(tan ma)})", "({jan} li {D1(tan) ma} tan {ma})"], "expect_asts": [{"predicates": [{"head": null, "objects": null, "sources": {"items": [{"groups": [], "head": [{"depth": 1, "type": "meta", "unit": [{"token": "tan", "type": "unit"}, {"token": "ma", "type": "unit"}]}], "type": "phrase"}], "type": "source_list"}, "type": "predicate"}], "subject": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "jan", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "type": "predication"}, {"predicates": [{"head": {"groups": [], "head": [{"depth": 1, "type": "meta", "unit": [{"token": "tan", "type": "unit"}]}, {"token": "ma", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "objects": null, "sources": {"items": [{"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "ma", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}], "type": "source_list"}, "type": "predicate"}], "subject": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "jan", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "type": "predication"}], "review": "ACCEPTED - author decision 2026-10-09"}
{"id": "canon-d4-05", "surface": "jan li tan ma tan ma tan ma", "rationale": "Pins folded token positions over folded runs. The reading {D2(tan ma)} folds positions {2..7}; the reading tan {D1(ma tan) ma} folds {3..6} with a different run set. By positions {3..6} is a strict subset of {2..7}, so only the first survives. The two readings differ only because the folded runs overlap, which is where comparing runs would give another answer.", "source_rule": "SPEC 2.18, 7; author decision 2026-10-09 D4 (comparison basis: folded token positions, not folded runs)", "expect_status": "RESOLVED", "expect_skeletons": ["({jan} li {D2(tan ma)})"], "expect_asts": [{"predicates": [{"head": {"groups": [], "head": [{"depth": 2, "type": "meta", "unit": [{"token": "tan", "type": "unit"}, {"token": "ma", "type": "unit"}]}], "type": "phrase"}, "objects": null, "sources": null, "type": "predicate"}], "subject": {"groups": [], "head": [{"token": "jan", "type": "unit"}], "type": "phrase"}, "type": "predication"}], "review": "ACCEPTED - author decision 2026-10-09"}
